; optout.example.test: NSEC3 with the opt-out flag (WP10.2). Signed per run with
; dnssec-signzone -3 - -A; the unsigned delegation child.optout.example.test has no DS and
; lies in an opt-out span, so it is insecure, not bogus.
$ORIGIN optout.example.test.
$TTL 300
@       IN SOA  bind.example.test. hostmaster.example.test. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@       IN NS   bind.example.test.
www     IN A    192.0.2.60
child   IN NS   bind.example.test.
